bin/
build/
dist/
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
docker-dso
dso-cli
dso-provider-*
# ...but the above is meant for built plugin *binaries*, and it also matches
# the plugin source directories (cmd/plugins/dso-provider-<name>/), which made
# new source files there silently un-addable. The existing main.go files were
# only tracked because they predate the rule. Re-include the source dirs.
!cmd/plugins/dso-provider-*/
dso-test

