# Exception: migrate's fixture .env files are test data (non-secret,
# fabricated values), not real environment/secret files, and are required
# for internal/cli's migration test suite to pass on a fresh clone.
!internal/cli/testdata/migrate/**/.env
test_local_secret
.claude
